        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a leading player in China’s online personal finance platform market, we face intensive competition from other online marketplaces, online finance service providers, technology giant backed internet finance platforms, as well as traditional financial institutions.",
        "start_character": 37232,
        "end_character": 37498
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052016",
